Here is a production-ready, standard Kubernetes Deployment YAML template running an Nginx web server. [1] (/goto?url=CAESjgEB6zswFTGYs8NRm3o24nOqlKJHvGldBUPrUhwjNHM4HC_VZ7cnt7OofK73oRLhG1avS0yK5mpG4-6fepks6LGHmfoWmJVU7m8ZXDfXt3lApS8FU15KK_RUCwlyXopdaX79CfdVWGxtHKYOjDyflutEoKdxFCqFJ7QNMhoXxOtZ8uvlCSt-JnlvTOFrzcW0)
yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: nginx-deployment
  labels:
    app: nginx
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx
  strategy:
    type: RollingUpdate
    rollingUpdate:
      maxSurge: 25%
      maxUnavailable: 25%
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: nginx-container
        image: nginx:1.25.3
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
        resources:
          requests:
            memory: "64Mi"
            cpu: "250m"
          limits:
            memory: "128Mi"
            cpu: "500m"
Use code with caution.

