• apiVersion & kind: Defines the Kubernetes object type. For deployments, this is always apps/v1. [1] (/goto?url=CAESjQEB6zswFR6z7UHKXuEah7U8MpP0A2mEqpsaY1CGuCBinp0rt-BSHhBx-KFkNPZynBdOuY_bYnNXRQv-NonNLStMZt1tsBTrj2UJAWKgeLCMG4WCYXUNs4U-UDVEf2gjBnQGULfglelz-JaDrk3SPUpStN6n6YgpXAzVwh29nwHrvHLPl6XFNY3xP50RWi4)
