• spec.replicas: The target number of identical pods Kubernetes will continuously run. [1] (/goto?url=CAESmQEB6zswFWLiwFyfXIJn4x_St4MEXLGSe7zzITB4I74zHVsjVmME5fM79PSwSvvwULxrZutTnEmXHS1K2MivpgNU3p0-ojpGzTqKNlcVwqWHcdE0sobMiYL661YH85QSfWBw7kFHFk6ahDTUqrP8ODL671bRLtw1RA32aK8yUQjHZEX72mO0rHIDOhx1tvsUVtsMTn-O0BUTQEo), [2] (/goto?url=CAESYwHrOzAVi4Nc6_8fH99ws1OGGJioVkp3bjndipyB_xNyaLDvgqtYAEKQQ6xbAyUzeRIsq_VMZraUYK2rY64NWzAt36kYSH7ZnOsEd9XZm7HcfkVp8WIUClRl8X6d-zf5uIvdOg)
