• strategy: Controls how pod updates roll out. RollingUpdate safely updates containers sequentially to prevent application downtime. [1] (/goto?url=CAESkQEB6zswFaRZK_rhFssltoiIY3Xn1H6wBD5aTJlX_8F1U1uNTyaYunwvz15PgahsBh6-GfGi5NkICflTl7gnfBGScS1hF-wIBUBlyGED7J2ewDLkHkyT6uuAGpBmWjpqarbpw61B9cAWfSYma4PPxWhyM2XWLF_dP5R0cMRUpO5W5Qx2kvEUIY7KGSZEgzHAsp6c)
• template: The exact blueprint used to spawn new pods when scaling or replacing instances. [1] (/goto?url=CAESiwEB6zswFWJoq-SiYErngwp7Qw65GxTBRds96Dgo0ciTxmu71uvFEtFjrbpQIU9U0bESgDDuU8VKO3J1Dz7Nn3-xv0_DywBpfd94x6lCh1LyQUczVw32J2z2YDSfBwMMQRen2PjwgAn4UYXrZrmCj6f0n7R0mMfvHsAMcIH9Qo5s3my_25YCSJT0pQPZ), [2] (/goto?url=CAESYwHrOzAVi4Nc6_8fH99ws1OGGJioVkp3bjndipyB_xNyaLDvgqtYAEKQQ6xbAyUzeRIsq_VMZraUYK2rY64NWzAt36kYSH7ZnOsEd9XZm7HcfkVp8WIUClRl8X6d-zf5uIvdOg)
